# Ticket tout. Sells fake lottery slips (100 sat). Carries chief_landry's bat_badge. Flags: benny_badge_gone
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Golden Ticket lottery! One slip, one draw, one berth to the stars. Hundred sat. You look lucky.
#
o_text: One slip.
o_id: benny_buy_slip
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 100)
o_goto: BuySlip
#
o_text: Landry's badge. Hand it over before he does it himself.
o_id: benny_persuade
o_cond: !HasFlag('benny_badge_gone')
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Easy')
o_succ: BadgeGiven
o_fail: BadgeRefused
#
o_text: Two hundred for the badge in your pocket.
o_id: benny_buy_badge
o_cond: !HasFlag('benny_badge_gone') && HasItem('gold', 200)
o_goto: BadgeSold
#
o_text: Not today.
o_id: benny_leave
o_goto: End

name: BuySlip
npc: Draw date to be announced. Keep it dry. (He is already looking past you for the next one.)
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 100)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'lottery_slip')
#
o_text: Thanks.
o_id: benny_slip_done
o_goto: Default

name: BadgeGiven
npc: (The smile stays, the hand moves.) Found it on the ground. Honest. Tell him that.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'bat_badge')
effect: SetFlag('benny_badge_gone')
#
o_text: Sure you did.
o_id: benny_badge_done
o_goto: End

name: BadgeSold
npc: Two hundred, and we never had this conversation.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 200)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'bat_badge')
effect: SetFlag('benny_badge_gone')
#
o_text: What conversation.
o_id: benny_sold_done
o_goto: End

name: BadgeRefused
npc: Badge? I sell slips. Try the lost and found, friend.
#
o_text: We'll see.
o_id: benny_refused_leave
o_goto: End

name: End
npc: Lottery! Lottery here!
effect: EndConversation
